OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA dry day on Sunday and feeling
OL,6,Fvery warm in the sunny spells. Some
OL,7,Fpatchy cloud developing in the
OL,8,Fafternoon, but still plenty of
OL,9,Fsunshine.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA bright evening across the
OL,12,Fregion, with sunny spells for all.
OL,13,FRemaining dry overnight with clear
OL,14,Fspells developing. Rather warm
OL,15,Fovernight.
OL,16,
OL,17,CMonday:FDry, with clear or sunny
OL,18,Fspells, cloud increase across the west
OL,19,Fat times making skies a little hazy.
OL,20,FFeeling very warm and humid.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
